# This repo is authored on Windows but consumed entirely on Linux -- the
# containerlab VM runs the playbooks, containerlab reads the day-0 template,
# and GitLab CI lints the YAML on a Linux runner.
#
# Without this, Git stored CRLF in the blobs, and a checkout on Linux (where
# core.autocrlf is unset) wrote them back out as CRLF. yamllint fails every
# such file with "wrong new line character: expected \n".
#
# Normalise everything to LF in the repository. Windows working copies are
# unaffected in practice -- every editor here handles LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Rendered device configs and the day-0 boot template are fed to EOS and to
# containerlab on Linux; they must be LF.
*.cfg   text eol=lf
*.tmpl  text eol=lf
